  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch8-mcq-001",
      "text": "কোনো বিন্দুতে ক্রিয়ারত P ও Q বল দুটি তাদের লব্ধি R বলের উভয় দিকে যথাক্রমে \\(30^\\circ\\) ও \\(60^\\circ\\) কোণে আনত। বলদ্বয়ের অনুপাত কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(1 : \\sqrt{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{3} : 1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} : 1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{2} : \\sqrt{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(R\\) এর লম্ব দিকে বলের উপাংশ সমান: \\(P\\sin30^\\circ=Q\\sin60^\\circ\\)।\n\\(\\dfrac PQ=\\dfrac{\\sin60^\\circ}{\\sin30^\\circ}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3/2}{1/2}=\\sqrt3\\)।\n\\(P:Q=\\sqrt3:1\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 9,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch8-mcq-002",
      "text": "2N ও \\(2\\sqrt{3}\\)N মানের বলদ্বয় \\(30^\\circ\\) কোণে ক্রিয়ারত। 2N মানের বল বরাবর বলদ্বয়ের লম্বাংশের সমষ্টি কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(4\\sqrt{3}\\) N",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "5N",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "7N",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{3} + 2\\)N",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "2N বল বরাবর লম্বাংশের সমষ্টি \\(=2+2\\sqrt3\\cos30^\\circ\\)\n\\(=2+2\\sqrt3\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}=2+3=5\\) N।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 10,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch8-mcq-003",
      "text": "P ও Q \\((P > Q)\\) বলদ্বয়ের মধ্যবর্তী কোণ α এবং এদের লব্ধি R হলে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "\\(P = Q\\) হলে \\(R = 2P\\cos\\alpha/2\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(\\alpha = 90^\\circ\\) হলে \\(\\tan\\theta = Q/P\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "লব্ধি R, Q বলের সাথে সমকোণ উৎপন্ন করলে \\(\\cos\\alpha = -Q/P\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "i: \\(P=Q\\) হলে \\(R=\\sqrt{2P^2(1+\\cos\\alpha)}=2P\\cos\\dfrac\\alpha2\\), সত্য।\nii: \\(\\alpha=90^\\circ\\) হলে \\(\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac{Q\\sin\\alpha}{P+Q\\cos\\alpha}=\\dfrac QP\\), সত্য।\niii: \\(R\\perp Q\\) হলে \\(Q+P\\cos\\alpha=0\\) ⇒ \\(\\cos\\alpha=-\\dfrac QP\\), সত্য।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 12,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch8-mcq-004",
      "text": "P ও Q বলের লব্ধি ক্ষুদ্রতম হলে, বলদ্বয়ের অন্তর্ভুক্ত কোণ—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(0^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(30^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(120^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(180^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(R^2=P^2+Q^2+2PQ\\cos\\alpha\\); \\(\\cos\\alpha=-1\\) অর্থাৎ \\(\\alpha=180^\\circ\\) হলে \\(R=|P-Q|\\) ক্ষুদ্রতম হয়।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 13,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch8-mcq-005",
      "text": "কোনো বিন্দুতে ক্রিয়াশীল P এবং Q বলের লব্ধি R। \\(P = Q = R\\) হলে P, Q বলের অন্তর্গত কোণ কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(120^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(90^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(60^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(45^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(R^2=P^2+Q^2+2PQ\\cos\\alpha\\) এ \\(P=Q=R\\):\n\\(P^2=2P^2+2P^2\\cos\\alpha\\) ⇒ \\(\\cos\\alpha=-\\dfrac12\\) ⇒ \\(\\alpha=120^\\circ\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 18,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
