          "text": "\\(90^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(120^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(150^\\circ\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(1^2+(\\sqrt3)^2=2^2\\), তাই 1 ও \\(\\sqrt3\\) বলদ্বয় পরস্পর লম্ব।\nশেষ দুই বল 2 ও \\(\\sqrt3\\) এর মধ্যবর্তী কোণ \\(\\theta\\) হলে \\(1^2=2^2+(\\sqrt3)^2+2\\cdot2\\sqrt3\\cos\\theta\\)।\n\\(\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{-6}{4\\sqrt3}=-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}2\\) ⇒ \\(\\theta=150^\\circ\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 20,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
